# BRAINET Local Configuration
# Prompts are kept in server/prompts/ but not version controlled
# (proprietary content from Obsidian vault)
# Placeholder files are committed; replace with actual prompts locally
# See supabase/README.md and docs for migration instructions
server/prompts/*.md
!server/prompts/.gitkeep

